          "case": "mutually exclusive dates and Darwin-added ending",
          "primary_reading": null,
          "primary_reading_basis": null,
          "requirement": "June 26 OR July 3, 1856 are mutually exclusive XML alternatives. P6 terminal words absolutely identical with S. European local plants are in Darwin’s hand and only presumed copied from missing Hooker text; retain that uncertainty and exclude them from unqualified Hooker-autograph prompt scope. Keep undated annotations separate.",
